{"id":"n78357-1-8","stage":5,"title":"짊어지다 · 背","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78357-1-8-1","ko":"이 많은 짐을 언제 다 옮기지?","zh":"这么多行李，什么时候才能搬完啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짐을","meaning":"行李，货物","explanation":"짐：行李，货物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"1","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옮기지?","meaning":"搬，移，挪","explanation":"옮기다：搬，移，挪；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"1","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"行李，货物","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"为搬到他处而打包的物品。","pronunciation":["짐"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"51842eae1c09c04b","term":"옮기다","zh":"搬，移，挪","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3","entryId":"67843","definition":"使从一处到另一处。","pronunciation":["옴기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0f704b2e8096ac12419c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78357-1-8-2","ko":"일단 큰 상자는 등에 짊어지고 작은 건 손으로 옮기자.","zh":"先把大箱子背在背上，小箱子就用手拿过去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일단","meaning":"首先","explanation":"일단：首先","readings":[{"term":"일단","audio":"/audio/47a337529350ca3ed26b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25132","senseId":"1","lemma":"일단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상자는","meaning":"箱子","explanation":"상자：箱子；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"상자","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62801","senseId":"1","lemma":"상자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"등에","meaning":"背，脊背，背部","explanation":"등：背，脊背，背部；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"등","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62455","senseId":"1","lemma":"등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짊어지고","meaning":"背","explanation":"짊어지다：背；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"짊어지다","audio":"/audio/d700e8aa35246601a757.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78357","senseId":"1","lemma":"짊어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작은","meaning":"小， 矮","explanation":"작다：小， 矮；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"1","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손으로","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옮기자.","meaning":"搬，移，挪","explanation":"옮기다：搬，移，挪；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"1","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"47a337529350ca3e","term":"일단","zh":"首先","audio":"/audio/47a337529350ca3ed26b.mp3","entryId":"25132","definition":"最先。","pronunciation":["일딴"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"e6bb1dea433d8fa4","term":"상자","zh":"箱子","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3","entryId":"62801","definition":"存放东西的木制或纸制四方形筒。","pronunciation":["상자"]},{"id":"ad8c9dea07d94cab","term":"등","zh":"背，脊背，背部","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3","entryId":"62455","definition":"人或动物的身体中胸部和腹部反面的部分。","pronunciation":["등"]},{"id":"d700e8aa35246601","term":"짊어지다","zh":"背","audio":"/audio/d700e8aa35246601a757.mp3","entryId":"78357","definition":"把行李一股脑儿放到背上或肩膀上。","pronunciation":["질머지다"]},{"id":"bc42f85bf5be37c9","term":"작다","zh":"小， 矮","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3","entryId":"69513","definition":"长度、宽度、体积等少于其他或一般尺寸。","pronunciation":["작ː따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"51842eae1c09c04b","term":"옮기다","zh":"搬，移，挪","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3","entryId":"67843","definition":"使从一处到另一处。","pronunciation":["옴기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c5793c2c961da7473f7a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.534,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78357","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":171,"sequenceScore":3.3607,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["先把大箱子背在背上，小箱子就用手拿过去吧。","这么多行李，什么时候才能搬完啊？","请不要对孩子太严厉地责骂。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这么多行李，什么时候才能搬完啊？","请不要对孩子太严厉地责骂。","先把大箱子背在背上，小箱子就用手拿过去吧。"],"answer":2}]}
